      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's not clear, but I think the FAQ already says that.\n\nQuote: \"You may also request that Persona delete your ID data at any time. This will not affect your Age Verification status.\"\n\nInterpretation: Persona doesn't need to keep \"ID data\" for you to retain your status.\n\nQuote: \"Some data must be stored with Persona while you maintain a Verified Account that lets us know if an ID has already been used.\"\n\nInterpretation: Persona does need to keep \"some (other) data\" for you to retain your status.\n\nQuote: \"Persona will retain your ID data for as long as necessary to provide Age Verification for VRChat.\"\n\nInterpretation: Less clear but, with this wording, the specification of \"ID data\", and the first quote, I believe they're referring to just the length of the process it takes to confirm your date of birth, rather than the length of your verified status.\n\nIf not, I believe it's something they actually need to do to comply with GDPR. I think data is only allowed to be kept as long as needed for its stated purpose. Once verification is done, anything that doesn't need to be kept to maintain that status (ID data), should be deleted.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
